    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that, but im not just looking for 'calm' areas. i need to know the specifics for my footage. like, which specific groups or parties are the ones actually driving the unrest? i want to make sure i'm not accidentally filming near groups that are considered extremist or just way too aggressive so i dont get caught in a riot. who are the main actors i should keep an eye on?",
